      "benefits": "Laboratory aging research: Epitalon/Epithalon induced telomerase activity and telomere elongation in cultured human fibroblasts. This is a cellular observation, not proof that it extends human life, reverses aging, improves sleep, or prevents disease. Findings about pineal extracts should not be treated as evidence for this synthetic peptide."
    }
